  "scope": "Complete M6 Wasm & N-API Product Completion manifest: unified `@openedges/pkl-wasm` (browser + Node, VFS, async loaders, pure-Wasm package archives) and `@openedges/pkl-napi` (dual ESM+CJS, native FS/HTTP/HTTPS/CA/proxy/projects/packages/external readers, non-blocking async + cancel/timeout/close), lossless BigInt/Uint8Array/UTF-16 & 64-bit clock, 4-way cross-target raw-byte parity (Java == Native == N-API == Wasm), clean-install packaging verification, and explicit capability-gap honesty (`capability-blocked` separated and never counted as compatibility passes). Freshness checks never claim runtime compatibility passes (`coverage_gate: null`).",
